WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:08.059
This is Catan Lens: a free, open-source helper for the most important decision in Catan, where to put your first two settlements.

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:10.909
Every board follows the official setup.

00:00:11.189 --> 00:00:16.799
The gold ring marks the strongest open corner, and the card beside the board says what it produces.

00:00:17.435 --> 00:00:25.776
Open "Why this corner?" for the reasoning in plain sentences: how much it produces, which resources, and whether they are rare on this board.

00:00:26.413 --> 00:00:28.248
Click any other corner to compare.

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:34.288
You get a grade, a share of the best score, and exactly what the best corner has that yours is missing.

00:00:34.924 --> 00:00:37.036
Take the best corner instead and keep it.

00:00:37.316 --> 00:00:42.180
The ring jumps to the best second settlement, the one that patches what your first is missing.

00:00:42.813 --> 00:00:47.570
There is a drill mode with sixteen levels, and you can enter the real board on your table.

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:51.306
It all runs in your browser, with no account and no tracking.
